IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPAYRAIL.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT RAIL-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-RAIL-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-RAIL-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD RAIL-FILE.
01 RAIL-LINE PIC X(120).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-RAIL-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-RAIL-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-CODE PIC X(08).
01 WS-STATE PIC X(08).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-RAIL PIC X(08).
01 LS-ACTIVE PIC X(01).
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-RAIL LS-ACTIVE LS-RC.
    MOVE "N" TO LS-ACTIVE
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-RAIL-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/etc/rails.cfg"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-RAIL-PATH
    OPEN INPUT RAIL-FILE
    IF WS-RAIL-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ RAIL-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM CHECK-RAIL
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE RAIL-FILE
    IF LS-ACTIVE NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

CHECK-RAIL.
    IF RAIL-LINE = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CODE WS-STATE
    UNSTRING RAIL-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-CODE WS-STATE
    END-UNSTRING
    IF WS-CODE = LS-RAIL AND WS-STATE = "ACTIVE"
        MOVE "Y" TO LS-ACTIVE
    END-IF.
